    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Feed The Chickens - Use The Mouse To Click On The Grass Ground To Place Feed. Corresponding Resources Are Required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Harvest Weeds - Move To The Grass With The Mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Stone Collection-Move To The Stone Through The Mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Cut Down Trees - Move The Mouse To The Trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Maintain The Coastline - Click The Mouse To Add Grass On The Sea Surface, Which Requires Corresponding Resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. White Noise - Full Of Chicken Crows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Mouse Operation-This Game Only Requires Mouse Operation.</p>",
